Package: sdic.libraries
Type: Package
Title: SDIC Utility Libraries for Employment Data Access
Version: 0.3.2
Date: 2026-04-16
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "SDIC",
           family = "Team",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "sdic.dados@mdic.gov.br",
           )
Description: Modern utility libraries for accessing Brazilian employment balance 
    data (saldo de emprego detalhado) from government statistical sources.
    Provides R6 classes and high-level functions with comprehensive error handling, 
    intelligent geographic and CNAE filtering, automatic column management, and 
    validation. Supports national, state, and municipal level data aggregation 
    with both individual and grouped analysis methods for Brazilian employment statistics.
